---
interface Props { group: string; first: any; count: number; }
const { group, first, count } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="vlog-player" data-player={group} data-initial={first.id} aria-label={group === 'study' ? '留學影音播放器' : '遊學影音播放器'}>
  <div class="player-screen">
    <button class="poster-play" type="button" aria-label={group === 'study' ? '播放留學精選影片' : '播放遊學精選影片'}><img data-role="image" src={first.thumbnail} alt={first.title} width="640" height="360" fetchpriority="high" /><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span></button>
    <div class="player-host" data-role="host" hidden><div id={`${group}-youtube-player`}></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="player-copy">
    <p class="player-kicker"><span data-role="country">{first.country}</span><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><span data-role="channel">{first.channelTitle}</span></p>
    <h3 data-role="title">{first.title}</h3>
    <p class="player-description" data-role="description">{first.description}</p>
    <div class="player-controls"><button type="button" data-action="previous">← 上一部</button><span class="queue-position" data-role="position">1 / {count}</span><button type="button" data-action="next">下一部 →</button></div>
    <div class="player-options"><label><input data-role="autoplay" type="checkbox" checked /> 自動播放下一部</label><button type="button" data-action="carousel" aria-pressed="false"><span data-role="pause-label">暫停輪播</span><span data-role="resume-label" hidden>繼續輪播</span></button></div>
    <div class="player-message" data-role="error" role="status" hidden><p>這部影片目前無法在此播放，請改至 YouTube 觀看，或選擇下一部。</p><a data-role="original" href={first.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">在 YouTube 觀看 ↗</a></div>
    <p class="player-message" data-role="blocked" role="status" hidden>瀏覽器已暫停自動播放，請點擊播放器繼續。</p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.vlog-player{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e0e8ee;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}.player-screen{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#071b2b}.poster-play{border:0;padding:0;display:block;position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;background:#071b2b;cursor:pointer}.poster-play img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}.poster-play>span{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:64px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#075b9bf0;color:white;font-size:22px}.poster-play:hover>span{background:#e32f42}.player-host{position:absolute;inset:0}.player-host :global(iframe){width:100%;height:100%;border:0}.player-copy{padding:18px 20px}.player-kicker{font-size:11px;color:#567087;margin:0 0 8px}.player-copy h3{font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;color:#132f45;margin:0 0 10px}.player-description{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#526575;margin:0 0 18px;min-height:66px}.player-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.player-controls button{border:0;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:#ecf3f9;color:#173e5a;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.queue-position{font-size:11px;color:#64788a;margin:auto;white-space:nowrap}.player-options{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px;font-size:11px;color:#506575}.player-options label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer}.player-options input{accent-color:#075b9b}.player-options button{border:0;background:none;color:#506575;text-decoration:underline;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer}.player-message{padding:12px;background:#fff4e8;border-radius:8px;margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.player-message p{margin:0 0 5px}.player-message a{color:#075b9b;text-decoration:underline}@media(max-width:520px){.player-copy{padding:15px}.player-copy h3{font-size:19px}.player-description{min-height:0}}
</style>
